  "description": "This codemap traces the dependency graph analysis and overseer recommendation scoring systems. Graph analysis [1d] computes PageRank and critical paths [6e] from task dependencies, while the scorer [2e] combines these metrics with mailbox message counts [3b] to generate weighted recommendations. Key integration points include CLI commands [5a], PageRank persistence [4c], and end-to-end validation [7e].",
  "mermaidDiagram": "graph TB\n    subgraph CLI[\"CLI Layer\"]\n        5a[\"5a: Define CLI command\"]\n        5b[\"5b: Execute todo skill\"]\n        5e[\"5e: Emit output\"]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph Scorer[\"Overseer Scorer - Hub\"]\n        2a[\"2a: Invoke scorer\"]\n        2b[\"2b: Create analyzer\"]\n        2c[\"2c: Get mailbox counts\"]\n        2e[\"2e: Compute weighted score\"]\n        2f[\"2f: Sort by score\"]\n        2g[\"2g: Set top recommendation\"]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph GraphAnalysis[\"Graph Analysis Engine\"]\n        1a[\"1a: Scorer invokes analyzer\"]\n        1b[\"1b: Initialize graph\"]\n        1c[\"1c: Add edges\"]\n        1d[\"1d: Compute PageRank\"]\n        1e[\"1e: Calculate critical paths\"]\n        1f[\"1f: Topological sort\"]\n        1g[\"1g: Return insights\"]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph CriticalPath[\"Critical Path Algorithm\"]\n        6a[\"6a: Invoke computation\"]\n        6b[\"6b: Define DFS closure\"]\n        6c[\"6c: Detect cycles\"]\n        6d[\"6d: Get successors\"]\n        6e[\"6e: Recurse and increment\"]\n        6f[\"6f: Memoize result\"]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph Mailbox[\"Message Counting\"]\n        3a[\"3a: Query counts per task\"]\n        3b[\"3b: Execute SQL query\"]\n        3c[\"3c: Classify senders\"]\n        3d[\"3d: Return counts\"]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph Persistence[\"PageRank Storage\"]\n        4a[\"4a: Persist scores\"]\n        4b[\"4b: Begin transaction\"]\n        4c[\"4c: Prepare statement\"]\n        4d[\"4d: Execute updates\"]\n        4e[\"4e: Commit\"]\n    end\n    \n    subgraph E2E[\"End-to-End Test\"]\n        7a[\"7a: Create analyzer\"]\n        7b[\"7b: Analyze graph\"]\n        7c[\"7c: Send message\"]\n        7d[\"7d: Create scorer\"]\n        7e[\"7e: Generate recommendations\"]\n        7f[\"7f: Validate results\"]\n    end\n    \n    5a --\u003e 5b\n    5b --\u003e 2a\n    5e -.receives output from.- 2g\n    \n    2a --\u003e 2b\n    2b --\u003e 1a\n    2a --\u003e 2c\n    2c --\u003e 3a\n    \n    1a --\u003e 1b\n    1b --\u003e 1c\n    1c --\u003e 1d\n    1e --\u003e 6a\n    1d --\u003e 1e\n    1e --\u003e 1f\n    1f --\u003e 1g\n    \n    6a --\u003e 6b\n    6b --\u003e 6c\n    6c --\u003e 6d\n    6d --\u003e 6e\n    6e --\u003e 6f\n    \n    3a --\u003e 3b\n    3b --\u003e 3c\n    3c --\u003e 3d\n    3d -.feeds into.- 2e\n    \n    1g -.provides metrics to.- 2e\n    2e --\u003e 2f\n    2f --\u003e 2g\n    \n    1d -.scores persisted via.- 4a\n    4a --\u003e 4b\n    4b --\u003e 4c\n    4c --\u003e 4d\n    4d --\u003e 4e\n    \n    7a --\u003e 7b\n    7b -.similar flow.- 1a\n    7c -.influences.- 7e\n    7d --\u003e 7e\n    7e -.validates.- 2e\n    7e --\u003e 7f\n    \n    style CLI fill:#a5d8ff\n    style Scorer fill:#ffec99\n    style GraphAnalysis fill:#b2f2bb\n    style CriticalPath fill:#d0bfff\n    style Mailbox fill:#fcc2d7\n    style Persistence fill:#ffd8a8\n    style E2E fill:#99e9f2"
